 deliv=[('donor-a','Your 80 has reached CedarHands, account BEN44, for the craft packs. We kept that purpose when updating the public story.|你的80已到CedarHands（BEN44），仍给手工包；公开故事改了，款没改用途。'),('donor-b','Your 40 has gone to CedarHands, account BEN44, for the craft packs as you asked.|你的40已按原要求到CedarHands（BEN44），用于手工包。'),('subject','The public C4 attachment no longer has that story or the details that point to you. I left the pack photo, as you asked.|公开C4里那段经历和能认出你的细节都删掉了，只留下你同意的那张手工包照片。'),('beneficiary','The 80 and 40 transfers to BEN44 are complete, and all six P6 packs have arrived on B44-R.|80和40两笔款都已到BEN44，六份P6也已按B44-R交到。'),('carrier','The community desk has received all six P6 packs on B44-R. Thanks for the delivery.|社区台已按B44-R收齐六份P6，谢谢送到。'),('main','The campaign now uses the corrected nonidentifying craft-pack photo. The two restricted donations stayed with their original beneficiary purpose; the promised packs have a recorded handover.|募捐页面已经更新，只留手工包照片。两笔捐款仍用在原来约好的受益项目，六份手工包也送到了。'),('old-answer','Changing a campaign story does not release restricted donations for another purpose. Matching grants must be checked against their actual approved snapshot.|故事改稿不会让定向款可挪他用，配捐也须按实际获准快照核。')]
