def quilt(branch='A'):
 sources=[('license','Underlying quilt pattern license|底层拼布图样许可','Pattern Q2 permits enrolled workshop teaching and eight printed packs plus one member digital group. Credit “Pattern: Rowan”. It excludes selling the pack separately. Clean diagram E0 is already licensed for both channels.|Q2许可已报名工作坊教学、八份纸包加一个成员数字群，署“图样：Rowan”，不得单卖。干净E0已许两渠道。'),('translation','Translator’s distinct rights and private credit|译者独立权利与私人署名','Translator Lin licenses the full English/Chinese translation T2 for these enrolled groups and requests plain credit “Translation: Lin”. Lin’s private account link must not appear. Withdrawing one example does not withdraw this translation grant.|Lin许这两报名群用完整中英T2翻译，署纯文字“翻译：Lin”，不挂私人账号。撤一张示例不撤翻译许可。'),('image','Actual proof layer inspection result|实际校样图层检查结果',('Example E1 has a separate handwritten layer H1 over the same clean E0 diagram. Remove H1 only; no page size changes.' if branch=='A' else 'E1 flattens handwritten H1 into the diagram. It cannot be peeled off; replace E1 with licensed E0, whose taller size moves section 2 to page 4 and diagram to page 5.')+' H1 alone is withdrawn; clean diagram rights remain.|'+('E1上手写H1是独立层、底图同E0，仅去H1不改版面。' if branch=='A' else 'E1把H1压进图，不能单剥；用获准更高E0替换，第二节移第四页、图移第五页。')+'仅H1撤回，干净图许可保留。'),('pages','Current full bilingual page references|当前完整双语页码引用','Current pack T2 says section 2 page 3, diagram page 4. Both language columns refer to the same numbered diagrams. Reflow creates a fixed complete pack; editing a cover title does not update internal cross-references.|当前T2写第二节第三页、图第四页，两语栏指相同编号图。重排生成固定完整包，改封面不改内部引用。'),('printer','Actual printer proof and held plate custody|实际印厂校样与制版保管','Printer holds old plate P1 from annotated E1. It returns a proof of submitted fixed pack before print approval. Approving a different proof name cannot update P1. Replacement plate and eight actual printed copies are separate operations.|印厂持含批注E1的旧版P1，先按提交固定包回校样再批准印。批准另一个校样名字不会换P1，替换版与实际印八份是两项操作。'),('groups','Paid member download and print entitlements|已付成员下载与纸包权益','Group A owns full digital T2 via old token D1. Group B owns eight full printed T2 copies, to collect at community desk; exact pickup slot must be agreed after proof timing. Revoke D1 and deliver a new full-pack token, not just an apology.|A群有完整数字T2、旧令牌D1；B群有八份完整纸T2、社区台取，校样时间定后需约具体取件。撤D1并给新完整包令牌，不能只道歉。')]
 contacts=[provider('printer','Printer','printer','Send me the finished PDF. I can send a proof now, and you can sign off on that before we print.|现在可以帮你校样。把定稿文件发来，确认时就按我们回给你的那份校样。','I can proof this full revised pack. The proof I return will match the file you send.|这份完整修正版我可以校，回给你的校样会对应这次提交的文件。'),provider('group-b','GroupB','groups','We can collect eight printed packs at 16:00 if the approved proof is ready in time.|批准校样来得及的话，16:00可取八份纸包。','I accept community-desk collection 16:00 for the eight full packs.|可以，16:00去社区台取八份完整教材。')]
 contacts[0]['keys']=['pack','scope'];contacts[1]['keys']=['count','place','time']
 ops=[job('inspect','inspection','Inspect actual held proof layers|检查实际持有校样图层'),job('image','image','Apply scoped example correction|按范围修示例','inspection'),job('refs','references','Update real bilingual internal page references|改真实双语内部页引用','image'),job('reflow','reflow','Reflow complete bilingual source|重排完整双语源','image','references'),job('render','pack','Render fixed complete pack|导固定完整包','reflow'),job('proof','proof','Submit fixed pack and receive actual printer proof|交固定包取得实际印厂校样','pack',accepted=['printer']),job('approve','approval','Approve the actual returned proof|批准实际返回校样','proof'),job('plate','plate','Replace actual held print plate|换实际持有印版','approval'),job('print','print','Print paid full-pack quantity|印已付完整包数量','plate'),job('revoke','old_token','Revoke old member download token|撤旧成员下载令牌','pack'),job('token','new_token','Issue corrected full-pack member token|签修正版完整包成员令牌','pack','old_token'),job('collection','collection','Reserve printed-pack actual collection|订纸包实际取件','print',accepted=['group-b'])]
 keys=[['example'],['image','action'],['section2_page','diagram_page'],['pack','language_scope'],['snapshot'],['snapshot'],['proof'],['plate','proof'],['count','pack'],['token'],['token','snapshot','group'],['count','place','time']]
