 deliv=[('group-a','The new download D3 has the full corrected bilingual pack and clean diagrams. The old D1 link is off.|新版下载D3好了，里面是完整双语教材和干净图。旧D1已经关闭。'),('group-b','Eight corrected full packs have been printed from actual plate P3/PR3. Your community-desk collection is booked 16:00.|八份修正教材已经按确认过的P3版印好了，16:00到社区台取就行。'),('translator','Your full translation is still there, with just the credit “Translation: Lin”, as requested. I left out the private account link.|完整翻译都留着，按你说的只写“翻译：Lin”，没放私人账号链接。'),('author','Both the download and printed packs now leave out handwritten example H1. The clean diagram and “Pattern: Rowan” credit are kept.|下载版和印刷版都去掉了手写示例H1，干净图还在，也保留了“图样：Rowan”的署名。'),('main','The enrolled workshop pack is updated in both languages. The withdrawn handwritten example is out, with the full translated instructions and licensed clean diagrams kept.|工作坊的双语教材更新好了。手写示例已拿掉，完整翻译说明和干净图都还在。'),('old-answer','The translator owns their translation, while the pattern and example images have their own grants. We corrected the affected example without canceling the full paid workshop materials.|译者拥有翻译，图样和示例图另有许可。本次只修受影响示例，不取消已付完整教材。')]
